### 🎭 5. Simple Decorator (`simple_decorator.py`)

```python
def decorator(func):
    def wrapper():
        print("Before Function")
        func()
        print("After Function")
    return wrapper

@decorator
def greet():
    print("Hello, Jahnavi!")

greet()
```

---

### 🎭 6. Logging Decorator (`logging_decorator.py`)

```python
def log(func):
    def wrapper():
        print("Function Started")
        func()
        print("Function Ended")
    return wrapper

@log
def display():
    print("Displaying Data")

display()
```

