### ⚙️ 7. Simple Generator (`simple_generator.py`)

```python
def numbers():
    yield 1
    yield 2
    yield 3

for num in numbers():
    print(num)
```

---

### ⚙️ 8. Generator with Loop (`generator_loop.py`)

```python
def even_numbers():
    for i in range(2, 11, 2):
        yield i

for num in even_numbers():
    print(num)
```

