### 💻 10. Mini Project – Ticket Number Generator (`ticket_generator.py`)

```python
def ticket_generator():
    for ticket in range(1001, 1006):
        yield ticket

print("Ticket Numbers:")
for ticket in ticket_generator():
    print(ticket)
```

